<p>kisi ka qaana-e- ummed be charaagh na ho<br />
jawaan bete ka dilko pidar ke daagh na ho<br />
hazaar baagh lute par qizaa'n ye baagh na ho<br />
pisar ke gham me paresha'n dil-o- dimaagh na ho</p>

<p>falak balaa ka shah-e- karbala pe toota hai<br />
musaaferi me barabar ka laal choota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo laal jisko na pahonche koi durre shahwaar<br />
wahid-e- asr shabaahat me ahmed-e- muqtaar<br />
hamesha misl-e-ali rozedaar shab bedaar<br />
shujaa-o- muttaqi-o-khush mizaaj-o- ghirat daar</p>

<p>ye sab kamaal mile zer-e qaak ek din me<br />
tamaam hogaye atthara saal ke sin me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>batool kehti thi faryaad ya ali faryaad<br />
meri bahu huwi barbaad ya ali faryaad<br />
bajaa-e- rehem hai bedaad ya ali faryaad<br />
khuda ke waaste do daad ya ali faryaad</p>

<p>duhaayi yousuf-e- aal-e- abaa ko maara hai<br />
jawaa'n ko maara hai naakit quda ko maara hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likha hai wa aba'taa ki joo'n hi sadaa aayi<br />
hussain imaam ke chehre pa murdani chaa yi<br />
wo aah ki ke zari-e- rasool tharraayi<br />
rawaana hogayi ashko'n ke saath beenaayi</p>

<p>sawar-e- dosh-e- payambar ki aas toot gayi<br />
inaane sabr jo thaami lagaam choot gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pukaarte hai pisar ko pisar nahi aata<br />
jigar me dard hai laqte jigar nahi aata<br />
koi rafeeq-e- shahe bahrobar nahi aata<br />
tumhaare bhaai ko rasta nazar nahi aata</p>

<p>pisar ke gham me quzaada mera halaak huwa<br />
basa basaaya ghar unsat(59) baras ka qaak huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yahaa'n to fizza ye karti thi dard ki taqreer<br />
asaa-e aah utha kar udhar chale shabbir<br />
andhera saamne ankho'n ke aur dil e tagheer<br />
har ek baar ye naara ke ya janab-e- ameer</p>

<p>kabhi uthe kabhi sultan-e- mashraqain gire<br />
likha hai ye ke bahattar jagah hussain gire<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qadam qadam pa taharte the shaah-e- tishna guloo<br />
hawa me soongte the apne laal ki qushboo<br />
zamee'n pa baith ke gaahe bahaate the aansoo<br />
talaash karte the haatho'n se laash ko har soo</p>

<p>jo koi poochta tha kya huzoor dhoodte hain<br />
to roke kehte the aankho'n ka noor dhoondte hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qareeb-e- fouj jo sultaan-e- bahrobar aaye<br />
pukaare has ke adu qair hai kidhar aaye<br />
ye koun margayaa jo aap nange sar aaye<br />
piyaada dhoop me thaame huwe jigar aaye</p>

<p>ye koun chand huwa aaj door aankho'n se<br />
ke chain dil se gaya aur noor aankho'n se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kahaa hussain ne rokar tumhe nahi maloom<br />
hamare ghar me hai mahshar tumhe nahi maloom<br />
miti shabeehe payambar tumhe nahi maloom<br />
chuta hussain se akbar tumhe nahi maloom</p>

<p>rulaane ko ye imaam-e-umam se poochte ho<br />
churi phirake kaleje pa ham se poochte ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye aankhe'n waalo mera noor-e- ain kis jaa hai<br />
jawaano bolo mere dil ka chain kis jaa hai<br />
jawaan-e faatahe badr-o hunain kis jaa hai<br />
zaeefo ainak-e chashme hussain kis jaa hai</p>

<p>kaho rasool ki tasveer ko kahaa'n khoyaa<br />
asaa-e- peeri-e shabbir ko kahaa'n khoyaa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pukaara shimr ke koi nahi bataane ka<br />
badaa sawaab hai saadat ke rulaane ka<br />
na zinda chodenge bachha bhi is gharane ka<br />
iraada hai ali asghar ke qoo'n bahaane ka</p>

<p>jo teer paar ho nanhe gale se eid kare<br />
tumhaari god me shishmahe ko shaheed kare<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zaeef baap ki peeri pa raham farmaao<br />
qadam qadam pa na jangal ki qaak chan'waao<br />
jo mujh pa haste hai tum unko aankh dikhlaao<br />
ali kaa naam lo aur doud kar chale aao</p>

<p>bulaalo dada ko nazdeek hai najaf beta<br />
akele paau'n ragadte ho kis taraf beta<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>